{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11104220","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11104220","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1110422001:0":{"text":"용사는 약속을 지키는 법. 다른 사람들이 오기 전에 빨리 떠나.","source_cn":"我会信守诺言，其他人赶来之前，快些离开吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD977EA1F47342AEB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1110422002:0":{"text":"정말 보내주는 거예요? 오우거한테는 뭐라고 할 거죠?","source_cn":"真的放我们走？那你怎么跟奥格交待？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC40FA8730B11852D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1110422003:0":{"text":"걱정 마. 오우거는 그렇게 잔인한 사람이 아니야. 친동생에게 모질게 굴진 않을 거야.","source_cn":"放心。奥格并非残暴之人，也不会对他的亲弟弟下手太狠。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5A7CDE232C591F34","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1110422004:0":{"text":"조심해, 크루거.","source_cn":"保重，克鲁格。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF2908546D79EDA4A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:克鲁格":{"text":"크루거","source":"克鲁格","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:阿尔萨":{"text":"아르사","source":"阿尔萨","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:索恩":{"text":"소렌","source":"索恩","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":3}}